ousing and separate admission steps.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/expansion-20261022/italy-toscana-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-22\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-22\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/dsu-toscana/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do all renewals avoid financial documents?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The published exception is conditional on previous award status, the study level and unchanged circumstances; other profiles must follow the document requirements.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the 2026/27 application still open?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The Pisa page lists 7 September 2026 at 13:00 as the deadline, which has passed. Consult official notices for your status or a newly announced cycle.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does this replace applying to Pisa, Florence or Siena?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. University admission and enrolment are separate from the regional benefit request.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L17"}],false,"$L18","$L19"]}]
