and preparing evidence. A future cycle needs its own published call, dates and financial reference year. Already submitted applicants should follow their portal status and current notices rather than submit a duplicate application."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L1a","$undefined"]}],"$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f"]}],false,"$L20","$L21"]}],"$L22"]}]
